"[impure](../development/experimental-features.md#xp-feature-impure-"
"derivations)"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/derivation-aterm.md:123
msgid ""
"A deferred output does not use a kind of addressing of its own: it is input-"
"addressed, but its path is not yet known, which happens downstream of a "
"floating content-addressed input. Nothing gates it. Floating outputs require "
"[`ca-derivations`](../development/experimental-features.md#xp-feature-ca-"
"derivations) and impure ones [`impure-derivations`](../development/"
"experimental-features.md#xp-feature-impure-derivations); a fixed-output one "
"additionally requires [`dynamic-derivations`](../development/experimental-"
"features.md#xp-feature-dynamic-derivations) if its method is `text:`."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/derivation-aterm.md:127
msgid ""
"The `method-prefix` of `hash-algo` is the [content addressing method](../"
"store/store-object/content-address.md):"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/derivation-aterm.md:129
msgid "prefix"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/derivation-aterm.md:129
msgid "method"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/derivation-aterm.md:131
msgid "_(none)_"
msgstr ""

